WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.792
Rear doors · clear opening

00:00:00.792 --> 00:00:01.208
Open left door

00:00:01.208 --> 00:00:04.292
Open right door

00:00:04.292 --> 00:00:04.458
Close left door

00:00:04.458 --> 00:00:06.000
Close right door

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.958
Bed buckle · continuous belt connection and reinsertion

00:00:06.958 --> 00:00:10.250
Press red button · release tongue and belt

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:12.000
