00:00:19.792 --> 00:00:20.917
Press red button · release net; fixed ties stay

00:00:20.917 --> 00:00:22.625
Fetch wipe canister

00:00:22.625 --> 00:00:23.625
Return supplies

00:00:23.625 --> 00:00:25.000
Reconnect receiver to fixed tongue · secure net

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.917
Handset · firmer cable and replacement

00:00:25.917 --> 00:00:29.417
Pick up handset

00:00:29.417 --> 00:00:31.000
Return handset · cable settles

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:31.917
Power plug · unplug, hold and reconnect

00:00:31.917 --> 00:00:32.958
Withdraw power plug

00:00:32.958 --> 00:00:34.208
Hold disconnected plug

00:00:34.208 --> 00:00:35.333
Release plug · restrained cable drop

00:00:35.333 --> 00:00:37.000
Reconnect to socket
